      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/White_Deer%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "White Deer’s origins trace back to 1882 when the British-owned Francklyn Land and Cattle Company first settled the area and stocked cattle.",
